		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>The skeletal remains of hunters who kill for sport and bloodlust. Uses a bone bow.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 14 (leather), <strong>HP</strong> 47, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 claw +6 (1d6) or 3 longbow (far) +8 (1d8 + paralyze) or devour soul, <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +2, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> +2, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 10</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Devour Soul</strong>. Captures the soul of a dying mortal within close and consumes it, devouring the soul forever and regaining 3d6 HP.</p><p></p><p><strong>Paralyze</strong>. CON 15+ or paralyzed 1d4 rounds.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
